      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "YORK.\nSir John and Sir Hugh Mortimer, mine uncles,\nYou are come to Sandal in a happy hour;\nThe army of the Queen mean to besiege us.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
