      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "YORK.\nFive men to twenty! Though the odds be great,\nI doubt not, uncle, of our victory.\nMany a battle have I won in France\nWhenas the enemy hath been ten to one.\nWhy should I not now have the like success?",
